 **Edge Cases and Pitfalls:**
-*   **Precision Loss:** Quantizing SH coefficients may introduce color artifacts if the scale is not chosen carefully [S1, unofficial].
-*   **Depth Key Compression:** Aggressive compression may lead to sorting errors if depth precision is insufficient [S1, unofficial].
+*   **Precision Limits:** Quantization reduces SH coefficient precision, which may affect high-frequency appearance details [S1, unofficial].
+*   **Depth Precision:** Dynamic depth-key compression requires sufficient bit-depth to maintain correct front-to-back sorting order [S1, unofficial].
 
